tool.pen.name = Lekhanī
tool.pen.description = Maggaṃ karotha: koṇabindutthāya phusatha, tato vaṅkalekhāgaṇhanāni ākaḍḍhatha, pidahanatthāya paṭhamabinduṃ phusatha. Niṭṭhāpanaṃ maggaṃ saṇṭhānasantharaṃ karoti.
